/**
 * -- Air Freight cross-dock: a client's flight -> a UK hub -> couriers ---------
 * A client consolidates many boxes, each already wearing a UK courier label,
 * onto one air waybill (MAWB). The flight lands; the hub receives every box by
 * scan, sorts by courier, and hands them to courier depots. Our responsibility
 * ends at the handover. Replaces the old parcel Freight module.
 * Actor columns are plain uuids without relations (the FbaShipment precedent):
 * breadcrumbs resolved in one batch read, not relations to walk.
 */

enum AirFreightFlightStatus {
